      {
        "parameters": {
          "method": "POST",
          "url": "http://ollama:11434/api/chat",
          "sendBody": true,
          "specifyBody": "json",
          "jsonBody": "={{ {\n  model: $('Initialize Parameters').first().json.ollamaModel,\n  messages: [\n    { role: 'system', content: 'You are an Application Architect following ArchiMate 3.0 standard.\\n\\nMap requirements to a reference application architecture with these layers:\\n\\n## REFERENCE ARCHITECTURE LAYERS:\\n1. PRESENTATION: Mobile App (id-ac-mobile), Web Portal (id-ac-web)\\n2. GATEWAY: API Gateway (id-ac-gateway)\\n3. IAM: Identity Service (id-ac-identity)\\n4. SERVICE: Domain bounded contexts (id-ac-{domain})\\n5. ESB: Integration layer (id-ac-integration), Adapters (id-ai-adp-{ext})\\n6. EXTERNAL: Third-party systems (id-ac-ext-{name})\\n\\n## ID CONVENTIONS (FOLLOW EXACTLY):\\n- Components: id-ac-{kebab-case-name}\\n- External Components: id-ac-ext-{kebab-case-name}\\n- Services: id-as-{kebab-case-name}\\n- Interfaces: id-ai-{kebab-case-name}\\n- External Interfaces: id-ai-ext-{kebab-case-name}\\n- Adapter Interfaces: id-ai-adp-{kebab-case-name}\\n- Functions: id-af-{kebab-case-name}\\n- Data Objects: id-do-{kebab-case-name}\\n- Events: id-ae-{kebab-case-name}\\n\\n## RELATIONSHIP RULES:\\n- Gateway flows THROUGH Interfaces, not Components directly\\n- Component owns Interface (Composition)\\n- Interface exposes Service (Assignment)\\n- Function implements Service (Realization)\\n- Function accesses DataObject (Access with read/write)\\n- ApplicationService serves BusinessProcess (Serving)\\n\\nOnly include components explicitly mentioned or clearly implied by requirements.' },\n    { role: 'user', content: 'BRD: ' + JSON.stringify($('Collect BRD').first().json.brd).slice(0,8000) + '\\nBUSINESS_ARCH: ' + JSON.stringify({ actors: $('Validate Business Arch').first().json.businessArch?.actors || [], processes: $('Validate Business Arch').first().json.businessArch?.processes || [], services: $('Validate Business Arch').first().json.businessArch?.services || [] }).slice(0,6000) }\n  ],\n  stream: false,\n  format: { type: 'object', required: ['components','services','interfaces','functions','dataObjects','events','relationships'], properties: { components: { type: 'array', items: { type: 'object', required: ['id','name','type','layer'], properties: { id: { type: 'string' }, name: { type: 'string' }, type: { type: 'string' }, layer: { type: 'string' } } } }, services: { type: 'array', items: { type: 'object', required: ['id','name','type'], properties: { id: { type: 'string' }, name: { type: 'string' }, type: { type: 'string' } } } }, interfaces: { type: 'array', items: { type: 'object', required: ['id','name','type'], properties: { id: { type: 'string' }, name: { type: 'string' }, type: { type: 'string' } } } }, functions: { type: 'array', items: { type: 'object', required: ['id','name','type'], properties: { id: { type: 'string' }, name: { type: 'string' }, type: { type: 'string' } } } }, dataObjects: { type: 'array', items: { type: 'object', required: ['id','name','type'], properties: { id: { type: 'string' }, name: { type: 'string' }, type: { type: 'string' } } } }, events: { type: 'array', items: { type: 'object', required: ['id','name','type'], properties: { id: { type: 'string' }, name: { type: 'string' }, type: { type: 'string' } } } }, relationships: { type: 'array', items: { type: 'object', required: ['source','target','type'], properties: { source: { type: 'string' }, target: { type: 'string' }, type: { type: 'string' } } } } } },\n  options: { temperature: $('Initialize Parameters').first().json.ollamaTemperature, seed: $('Initialize Parameters').first().json.ollamaSeed }\n} }}",
          "options": {
            "timeout": 240000
          }
        },
        "id": "gen-app",
        "name": "Generate Application Architecture",
        "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
        "typeVersion": 4.3,
        "position": [
          2640,
