          "jsonBody": "={{ {\n  model: $('Initialize Parameters').first().json.ollamaModel,\n  messages: [\n    { role: 'system', content: 'You are an Infrastructure Architect. Output JSON with nodes, networks, deployments, artifacts, and relationships. Include: 1) Internal relationships between nodes/networks/deployments/artifacts (use ServingRelationship, CompositionRelationship, AssociationRelationship). 2) Cross-layer relationships from infrastructure nodes to application components (use RealizationRelationship - infrastructure realizes application component). Each relationship must have: source (element name), target (element name), type (ArchiMate relationship type).' },\n    { role: 'user', content: 'BRD: ' + JSON.stringify($('Collect BRD').first().json.brd).slice(0,5000) + '\\nAPP_ARCH: ' + JSON.stringify($('Validate Application Arch').first().json.applicationArch).slice(0,6000) + '\\nDATA_ARCH: ' + JSON.stringify($('Validate Data Arch').first().json.dataArch).slice(0,5000) }\n  ],\n  stream: false,\n  format: { type: 'object', required: ['nodes','networks','deployments','artifacts','relationships'], properties: { nodes: { type: 'array' }, networks: { type: 'array' }, deployments: { type: 'array' }, artifacts: { type: 'array' }, relationships: { type: 'array', items: { type: 'object', properties: { source: { type: 'string' }, target: { type: 'string' }, type: { type: 'string' }, layer: { type: 'string' } }, required: ['source', 'target', 'type'] } } } },\n  options: { temperature: $('Initialize Parameters').first().json.ollamaTemperature, seed: $('Initialize Parameters').first().json.ollamaSeed }\n} }}",
